{
  "total_ms": 64890,
  "total_chars": 288,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "公园里老伙计凑过来：你退休金一个月多少啊？",
      "chars": 21,
      "speech_ms": 3960,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3960,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "你儿子挣得不少吧？",
      "chars": 9,
      "speech_ms": 1480,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 4360,
      "end_ms": 5840,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "说到相处的分寸，我想到《中国人的规矩》这本书，讲的就是咱们待人接物的老礼数。",
      "chars": 38,
      "speech_ms": 8350,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 6240,
      "end_ms": 14590,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "碰上打听收入，我自己的办法是三句话，笑着就挡回去了。",
      "chars": 26,
      "speech_ms": 5300,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 14990,
      "end_ms": 20290,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "问退休金：日常够用，我就不细报数了。",
      "chars": 18,
      "speech_ms": 3650,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 20690,
      "end_ms": 24340,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "问儿女工资：孩子们的事我不打听，他们孝顺就行。",
      "chars": 23,
      "speech_ms": 4800,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 24740,
      "end_ms": 29540,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "对方再追着问，您就哈哈一笑：老规矩，钱袋子的事，不兴细打听。",
      "chars": 30,
      "speech_ms": 6260,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 29940,
      "end_ms": 36200,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "其实打听的人未必有坏心，多半是闲聊没分寸——咱挡得巧，既不伤和气，也不露自家的底。",
      "chars": 41,
      "speech_ms": 9260,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 36600,
      "end_ms": 45860,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "说到底，谁家的收入都是一家人的隐私，跟交情深浅没关系；守住嘴，就是守住来往。",
      "chars": 38,
      "speech_ms": 9150,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 46260,
      "end_ms": 55410,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A10",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "这本书就在我主页橱窗里，点开我主页，商品橱窗里就有。",
      "chars": 26,
      "speech_ms": 5300,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 55810,
      "end_ms": 61110,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A11",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "被人追着打听过工资吗？您是怎么回的？",
      "chars": 18,
      "speech_ms": 2980,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 61510,
      "end_ms": 64490,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    }
  ]
}